{"id":"b12fbadd1e3ae795","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-definability.md","title":"Parameter-Free Definability in a Model","display":"df-definability — Parameter-Free Definability in a Model","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-definability","aliases":["92-df-definability"],"display":"df-definability — Parameter-Free Definability in a Model","depends_on":["[[92-df-formula]]","[[92-df-model]]","[[92-df-free-variable-function]]","[[92-df-assignment]]","[[92-df-interpretation]]"],"source":"第 II 章 p. 19；第 VIII 章 p. 97（PDF 36、114）","source_status":"模型语义的本地补充"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-definability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-definability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-definability — Parameter-Free Definability in a Model"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fd60117fc80e6f95\" href=\"?note=fd60117fc80e6f95\" title=\"92-df-model\">92-df-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" href=\"?note=b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" title=\"92-df-free-variable-function\">92-df-free-variable-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fdcbc43c728f79fc\" href=\"?note=fdcbc43c728f79fc\" title=\"92-df-assignment\">92-df-assignment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2b7f27c890af1dc3\" href=\"?note=2b7f27c890af1dc3\" title=\"92-df-interpretation\">92-df-interpretation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 II 章 p. 19；第 VIII 章 p. 97（PDF 36、114）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"模型语义的本地补充"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M=(M,I)\\in\\mathrm{Struc}_G\">\\(\\mathfrak M=(M,I)\\in\\mathrm{Struc}_G\\)</span> (structure, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fd60117fc80e6f95\" href=\"?note=fd60117fc80e6f95\" title=\"92-df-model\">92-df-model</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq M^k\">\\(S\\subseteq M^k\\)</span> (arity and relation parameter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> (formula set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_G\\)</span> (free-variable function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" href=\"?note=b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" title=\"92-df-free-variable-function\">92-df-free-variable-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}_G(M)\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}_G(M)\\)</span> (assignment set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"fdcbc43c728f79fc\" href=\"?note=fdcbc43c728f79fc\" title=\"92-df-assignment\">92-df-assignment</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_G\">\\(\\models_G\\)</span> (satisfaction relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"2b7f27c890af1dc3\" href=\"?note=2b7f27c890af1dc3\" title=\"92-df-interpretation\">92-df-interpretation</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Def}_{\\mathfrak M}\">\\(\\mathrm{Def}_{\\mathfrak M}\\)</span> (definition-target parameter-free definability predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}definability} \\vdash \\mathrm{Def}_{\\mathfrak M}(S)\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Struc}_G\\land\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_0,\\ldots,v_{k-1}\\}\\land S=\\{\\vec a\\in M^k\\mid\\exists\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assign}_G(M)\\;(\\bigwedge_{i&lt;k}\\beta(v_i)=a_i\\land\\mathfrak M,\\beta\\models_G\\varphi)\\}\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}definability} \\vdash \\mathrm{Def}_{\\mathfrak M}(S)\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Struc}_G\\land\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_0,\\ldots,v_{k-1}\\}\\land S=\\{\\vec a\\in M^k\\mid\\exists\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assign}_G(M)\\;(\\bigwedge_{i&lt;k}\\beta(v_i)=a_i\\land\\mathfrak M,\\beta\\models_G\\varphi)\\}\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>可定义性：公式刻画集合</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>由<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>在模型<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>中定义</li>\n<li>例：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{N}\">\\(\\mathbb{N}\\)</span>中PR谓词可定义</li>\n<li>真算术作为外部集合可写为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\ulcorner\\sigma\\urcorner\\mid\\mathfrak N_G\\models_G\\sigma\\}\">\\(\\{\\ulcorner\\sigma\\urcorner\\mid\\mathfrak N_G\\models_G\\sigma\\}\\)</span>；Tarski 定理断言不存在一个算术公式在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak N_G\">\\(\\mathfrak N_G\\)</span> 中定义这个真句码集合</li>\n<li>可定义性分层：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n\">\\(\\Sigma_n\\)</span>-可定义等</li>\n<li>与可表示性相关</li>\n<li>本文件的模型可定义性是语义概念；原书还有不同的证明论 define</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>这里 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Def}_{\\mathfrak M}\">\\(\\mathrm{Def}_{\\mathfrak M}\\)</span> 是模型中的无参数语义可定义性。原书第 VIII 章 define a relation in S 则是正负标准数码实例分别可证的证明论性质，详见<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"e5790b58acf0fb1c\" href=\"?note=e5790b58acf0fb1c\" title=\"92-df-complete-representability\">92-df-complete-representability</a>。因此“定义是语义概念”只适用于本文件模型意义，不能拿来解释原书该章的 define。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 II 章 p. 19；第 VIII 章 p. 97（PDF 36、114）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"fd60117fc80e6f95","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-free-variable-function","status":"resolved","id":"b9e3d57e94ce36b7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-free-variable-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"fdcbc43c728f79fc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-interpretation","status":"resolved","id":"2b7f27c890af1dc3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-interpretation]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"fd60117fc80e6f95","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak M=(M,I)\\in\\mathrm{Struc}_G$ (structure, see [[92-df-model]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}_G$ (formula set, see [[92-df-formula]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-free-variable-function","status":"resolved","id":"b9e3d57e94ce36b7","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FV}_G$ (free-variable function, see [[92-df-free-variable-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"fdcbc43c728f79fc","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Assign}_G(M)$ (assignment set, see [[92-df-assignment]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-interpretation","status":"resolved","id":"2b7f27c890af1dc3","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\models_G$ (satisfaction relation, see [[92-df-interpretation]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-complete-representability","status":"resolved","id":"e5790b58acf0fb1c","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Source]","excerpt":"这里 $\\mathrm{Def}_{\\mathfrak M}$ 是模型中的无参数语义可定义性。原书第 VIII 章 define a relation in S 则是正负标准数码实例分别可证的证明论性质，详见[[92-df-complete-representability]]。因此“定义是语义概念”只适用于本文件模型意义，不能拿来解释原书该章的 define。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak M=(M,I)\\in\\mathrm{Struc}_G","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq M^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Assign}_G(M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\models_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Def}_{\\mathfrak M}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}definability} \\vdash \\mathrm{Def}_{\\mathfrak M}(S)\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Struc}_G\\land\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_0,\\ldots,v_{k-1}\\}\\land S=\\{\\vec a\\in M^k\\mid\\exists\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assign}_G(M)\\;(\\bigwedge_{i<k}\\beta(v_i)=a_i\\land\\mathfrak M,\\beta\\models_G\\varphi)\\}\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"te